{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-timeagg-processes-month-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.64, step 7f. `scale-county-timeagg-processes-month`: `scale-county-timeagg-processes-day`'s selections -- every on-road process a county inventory selects -- at January, April, July and October 2020, with `<aggregateBy key=\"Month\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Month\"/>`, over the same county database (`inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`).\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is PreAggMONTH.sql on top of PreAggDAY.sql for the processes `scale-county-timeagg-month` did not select: the chained copies over collapsed parents, brake and tire wear over the DayWeighting1 speed distribution, and the evaporative chain over a SampleVehicleTrip whose every trip is at day 0, hour 0 (PLAN.md §7.3.64). Its output step, Month, is the one `scale-county-timeagg-month` (Year) did not take.\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to the (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs per (county, month) cell, recomputed as `rateSurvivorCount`.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "time-aggregation",
      "starts",
      "output-time-step",
      "evaporative",
      "refueling",
      "crankcase",
      "brake-wear",
      "tire-wear"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-processes-month/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-processes-month/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
      },
