        ],
        "note": "1 row, hourDayID 0 -- the SYNTHESIZED `Whole Week` cell PreAggMONTH.sql writes, which `dayofanyweek` does not name, so every time cell belongs to it.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_rateday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./selections/scale-county-timeagg-processes-month-rateday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_rateday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "THE DAY TYPES THE RUNSPEC SELECTED, dayIDs 2 and 5, read out of the RunSpec XML by `tools/runspec-day-selection.py` into `runspecs/selections/scale-county-timeagg-processes-month-rateday.parquet`: MOVES overwrites `RunSpecDay` with the synthesized day 0 AFTER the pre-aggregation has run (conventions §66.4). The execution database's tables were cut to these days before PreAggMONTH.sql collapsed them, so every collapse sums over them -- startsPerDay's `dayID/7`, startsOpModeDistribution's `dayID x startsPerDayPerVehicle`, the DayWeighting means.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_actday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
