      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "oracle",
          "expected-output",
          "output-time-step"
        ],
        "note": "The 78,512-row expected output at `<outputtimestep value=\"Month\"/>`: 19,628 rows in each of 4 months, dayID and hourID NULL, each the whole-week cell scaled by weeksPerMonth (AggregationSQLGenerator's convertWeeks). The model emits it from `mos_*`, the output relation summed to the output time step (`n_outputSumsDays` 1). Evaporative permeation has NO rows: TankTemperatureGenerator writes no AverageTankTemperature under the collapse (PLAN.md §7.3.64).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
