        ],
        "note": "30 rows: THC, CO and NOx (1, 2, 3) at running exhaust, start exhaust, extended idle and crankcase running, start and extended idle; Total Energy (91) at running, start and extended idle -- 9102 and 9190 added by MOVES as refueling's prerequisites (`flagRequiredPollutantProcesses`) and stripped from the output; THC at permeation, venting, leaks, refueling displacement and spillage (111, 112, 113, 118, 119); PM10 and PM2.5 brake and tire wear (10609, 11609, 10710, 11710).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
